'''Aer''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]] increases health and attack power. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]]. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]] increases health, standing range, LD coverage and gives guaranteed Knockback.

