==Trivia==
*Aer's name is a Latin word, translating to "Air" in English.
*Erphuan is a possible reference to [[bulbapedia:Whimsicott (Pokémon)|Whimsicott]], a sheep-like Grass/Fairy Pokémon whose Japanese name is Erufuun or Elfuun.
*While Aer was added alongside [[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bora]] and [[Mizli (Uber Rare Cat)|Mizli]], it likely represents the Flying type instead of the Grass type because [[Komori (Uber Rare Cat)|Komori]] is more plant-like.

